{"id":"conv_05093","context":"A uni student interviews a retired farmer at home","ambient":"living_room_quiet","cast":["hiroshi_elder","ren_uni"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Thank you for your time today. You ran a cattle ranch for many years, didn't you?","jp":"今日はお時間ありがとうございます。長年、牧場を経営されていたんですよね？","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[3,4,5,8,14,17,18,19,26,39,51,56,58,68,94,111,141,464,492,3682,5401,6485,7885,9081,17752],"jpTokens":[{"s":"今日","r":"きょう","w":141},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"お","w":56},{"s":"時間","r":"じかん","w":111},{"s":"ありがとう","w":492},{"s":"ござい","w":94},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"。"},{"s":"長年","r":"ながねん","w":3682},{"s":"、"},{"s":"牧場","r":"ぼくじょう","w":9081},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"経営","r":"けいえい","w":464},{"s":"さ","w":19},{"s":"れ","w":58},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"い","w":18},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"？"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"Yeah, when I was young I ran a dairy ranch. Now I've handed it to my son and grow vegetables on a small farm.","jp":"ああ、若い頃は乳牛の牧場をやっとった。今は息子に譲って、小さな農場で野菜を作っとるよ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,3,4,5,7,8,68,87,154,411,512,528,895,925,958,1055,1162,1251,1636,2005,9081,9118,11120,16307,16328],"jpTokens":[{"s":"ああ","w":1162},{"s":"、"},{"s":"若い","r":"わかい","w":1055},{"s":"頃","r":"ころ","w":411},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"乳牛","r":"にゅうぎゅう"},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"牧場","r":"ぼくじょう","w":9081},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"やっ","w":528},{"s":"とっ","w":1636},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"。"},{"s":"今","r":"いま","w":87},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"息子","r":"むすこ","w":1251},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"譲っ","r":"ゆずっ","w":16328},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"、"},{"s":"小さな","r":"ちいさな","w":925},{"s":"農場","r":"のうじょう","w":9118},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"野菜","r":"やさい","w":2005},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"作っ","r":"つくっ","w":895},{"s":"とる","w":1636},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"I've heard the environment surrounding agriculture right after the war had quite a different look from today.","jp":"戦後すぐの頃は、農業を取り巻く環境も今とはずいぶん違う様相だったと聞きました。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,3,5,8,9,11,14,21,28,73,87,285,411,423,440,904,1017,1451,2136,3140,4781,5944,9100,9117],"jpTokens":[{"s":"戦後","r":"せんご","w":2136},{"s":"すぐ","w":440},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"頃","r":"ころ","w":411},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"、"},{"s":"農業","r":"のうぎょう","w":1451},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"取り巻く","r":"とりまく","w":9100},{"s":"環境","r":"かんきょう","w":285},{"s":"も","w":11},{"s":"今","r":"いま","w":87},{"s":"と","w":9},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"ずいぶん","w":3140},{"s":"違う","r":"ちがう","w":423},{"s":"様相","r":"ようそう","w":9117},{"s":"だっ","w":21},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"と","w":9},{"s":"聞き","r":"きき","w":1017},{"s":"まし","w":14},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"Oh, completely different. There were no machines, the maps were rough too, so we walked trackless paths with a compass in hand.","jp":"そりゃもう全然違うわ。機械もないし、地図も粗くてな、方位磁針片手に道なき道を歩いたもんだ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[2,4,5,8,10,11,12,13,21,153,423,483,569,830,1332,1382,1489,2494,2619,3740,4439,6237,7385,9099,17866],"jpTokens":[{"s":"そりゃ","w":3740},{"s":"もう","w":153},{"s":"全然","r":"ぜんぜん","w":1332},{"s":"違う","r":"ちがう","w":423},{"s":"わ","w":569},{"s":"。"},{"s":"機械","r":"きかい","w":1489},{"s":"も","w":11},{"s":"ない","w":13},{"s":"し","w":10},{"s":"、"},{"s":"地図","r":"ちず","w":2494},{"s":"も","w":11},{"s":"粗く","r":"あらく"},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"な","w":12},{"s":"、"},{"s":"方位","r":"ほうい","w":9099},{"s":"磁針","r":"じしん"},{"s":"片手","r":"かたて","w":6237},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"道","r":"みち","w":483},{"s":"なき","w":13},{"s":"道","r":"みち","w":483},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"歩い","r":"あるい","w":2619},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"もん","w":830},{"s":"だ","w":21},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"We cleared the land all by our own strength. Hands and feet exhausted, we wrestled with the soil every single day.","jp":"開墾も全部自力でやった。手も足もくたくたになるまで、毎日土と格闘しとったよ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[2,7,8,9,11,